```gitignore
# Operating System files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Editor and IDE directories
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# Web / Build artifacts (if extended later)
*.log
.cache/
dist/
build/
```
